            <ArticleTitle>[Acute myocarditis: from chest pain to cardiogenic shock].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>97-102</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the observations of three patients with myocarditis. The first one with chest pain, the second one with a pseudo-infarct presentation and the third one with a cardiogenic shock. We discuss the different anatomo-clinical presentations of myocarditis, the diagnosis, the indications of endomyocardial biopsies and the prognosis of this pathology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
